# Citation metadata for this dataset (Citation File Format 1.2.0).
# GitHub and Zenodo read this file. Keep version and date-released in step with VERSION and release.json.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Design System Documentation Dataset"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
authors:
  - family-names: "Aleksić"
    given-names: "Stefan B."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-1537-296X"
abstract: >-
  A dataset of publicly documented design systems, UI libraries and style guidelines. For each entry it records
  documentation and governance facts as coded by the author (changelog, contributing guide, governance, accessibility,
  case study), the licence, the repository facts and a verification status. Evidence files and a reproducible
  build are included.
keywords:
  - design systems
  - documentation
  - governance
  - dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
# Repository code is MIT (see LICENSE); the dataset content is CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA).
# doi: to be added after deposit on Zenodo
repository-code: "https://github.com/stefanbaleksic/design-systems-documentation-dataset"
